# Kernel module build litter (regenerate: cd kernel_module && make)
# The compiled pfs_lkm.ko itself is kept -- source, Makefile, README, and
# the built module are all meant to be inspectable; only the intermediate
# Kbuild litter is excluded.
kernel_module/*.o
kernel_module/*.mod
kernel_module/*.mod.c
kernel_module/.*.cmd
kernel_module/Module.symvers
kernel_module/modules.order

